// Cross-validation of the Cangjie datagen port against upstream C output.
// Expected digests are embedded from corpus/datagen_ref.txt (committed for
// provenance), generated by scripts/datagen_ref.c against upstream
// LZ4 tests/datagen.c (Yann Collet, GPL-2). Embedding keeps the test
// independent of the runtime working directory.
// Port: Copyright (c) 2026, lz4cj contributors, BSD-2-Clause. See LICENSE.

